  "description": "The PDQ 4 combines two worlds thanks to its advanced geometry concept – the result is a bike that is efficient, fast, suitable for climbing and also great fun on downhills. 120 mm travel together with the long reach and 150 mm drop in the AXS Reverb seatpost (in frame size XL 170mm) provide the PDQ with outstanding handling and give you a feeling of safety on every trail. The lightweight carbon frame offers the perfect balance of stiffness and flexibility to feel uncompromisingly fast. The Newmen Advanced SL X carbon wheels are not only lightweight, but also stable for a great riding experience on rough roads, too. In short, an all-round package with selected components that leave nothing to be desired. ¹ approx. 9.5 kg, may vary by up to +/- 5 % due to manufacturing tolerances, weight for Oat Milk frame, size M, without pedals",
